---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import Asterisk from "@/components/ui/asterisk.astro";
---

<section id="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title" class="manifesto relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="paper grid-paper" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="floaters" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="float at-left mini-panel" style="--w: 20em; --gap: 4.5rem; --y: 12.5rem; --r: -2deg; --d: 19s;">
      <p class="mp-wordmark">Crumbs<Asterisk class="mp-ast" /></p>
      <div class="mp-searchrow">
        <span class="mp-search">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="mp-search-icon"
            ><circle cx="6.8" cy="6.8" r="4.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path
              d="M10.4 10.4 14 14"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg
          >Search
        </span>
        <span class="mp-more"
          ><svg viewBox="0 0 16 4"
            ><circle cx="2" cy="2" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="2" r="1.6"></circle><circle
              cx="14"
              cy="2"
              r="1.6"></circle></svg
          ></span
        >
      </div>
      <p class="mp-sec"><span>Research</span><i></i></p>
      <div class="mp-row">
        <span class="mp-check"></span>
        <p><b>Negation in inherited configs.</b> The moment a config can extend a base...</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mp-row">
        <span class="mp-check"></span>
        <p>Use <b>TOML</b> as the default format, backed by a schema.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="float at-right hud" style="--w: 9em; --gap: 6rem; --y: 20rem; --r: 3deg; --d: 15s;">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 16 24" class="hud-pointer"><path d="M1.5 1.5v18.2l4.4-4.2 2.9 6.7 2.9-1.3-2.9-6.6h6.2z"></path></svg>
      <span class="hud-pill"><Asterisk class="hud-ast" />Captured</span>
    </div>

    <div class="float at-right mp-card" style="--w: 17em; --gap: 7.5rem; --y: 38rem; --r: 2deg; --d: 23s;">
      <div class="mp-row">
        <span class="mp-check"></span>
        <p><code>git rebase --onto main old-base</code> before the review</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="float at-left mini-panel" style="--w: 19em; --gap: 6rem; --y: 54rem; --r: -1.5deg; --d: 21s;">
      <p class="mp-sec mp-sec-first"><span>For the chat</span><i></i></p>
      <div class="mp-row is-done">
        <span class="mp-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M3.2 6.3 5.2 8.3 8.9 4.2"></path></svg></span>
        <p>How should config migrations work?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mp-row is-done">
        <span class="mp-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M3.2 6.3 5.2 8.3 8.9 4.2"></path></svg></span>
        <p>Should plugins own their schema?</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mp-toast">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="8"></circle><path d="M4.6 8.3 7 10.6l4.4-5"></path></svg>
        Copied as List
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="float at-right mp-card" style="--w: 16em; --gap: 4.5rem; --y: 72rem; --r: -2.5deg; --d: 25s;">
      <div class="mp-row">
        <span class="mp-check"></span>
        <p>Lisbon: the <span class="mp-link">tram 28 tip</span> from that thread</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="float at-left keys" style="--w: 6em; --gap: 8rem; --y: 84rem; --r: 2deg; --d: 17s;">
      <span>⇧</span><span>⇧</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sheet">
    <h2 id="manifesto-title" class="title font-serif">Your notes app is too far away.</h2>

    <p>
      You're reading something. A{" "}
      <span class="app"><span aria-hidden="true" class="chip chip-web"><Icon name="bx:compass" /></span><span class="hand">web page</span></span>,
      a{" "}
      <span class="app"><span aria-hidden="true" class="chip chip-pdf"><Icon name="bx:bxs-file-pdf" /></span><span class="hand">PDF</span></span>,
      a{" "}
      <span class="app"><span aria-hidden="true" class="chip chip-term"><Icon name="bx:terminal" /></span><span class="hand">terminal</span></span>,
      a long{" "}
      <span class="app"><span aria-hidden="true" class="chip chip-chat"><Icon name="bx:bxs-message-rounded-dots" /></span><span class="hand">chat</span></span>.
      Then a line jumps out. <span class="hl">You'll want it later.</span>
    </p>

    <p>
      Saving it means switching apps, pasting, and{" "}
      <span class="wavy">finding your place again</span>. So you skip it and tell yourself you'll remember.{" "}
      <span class="hand">You won't.</span>
    </p>

    <blockquote class="pull font-quote">
      <p>“Save it the second you see it.”</p>
    </blockquote>

    <p>
      Crumbs lives in your menu bar. Select the text, tap <kbd class="kbd"><span aria-hidden="true">⇧</span><span class="sr-only">Shift</span></kbd> <kbd class="kbd"><span aria-hidden="true">⇧</span><span class="sr-only">Shift</span></kbd>, and
      keep going. It lands in a floating panel that <span class="hl">never steals focus</span>. Bold, links, code and
      lists come along as Markdown, and your clipboard is put back. Or type one, or paste with{" "}
      <kbd class="kbd"><span aria-hidden="true">⌘V</span><span class="sr-only">Command V</span></kbd>.
    </p>

    <p>
      By evening you have a <span class="hand">pile of crumbs</span>, one list per project. Sections, search,
      drag, merge, undo.
    </p>

    <blockquote class="pull font-quote">
      <p>“Collect now. Sort it out later.”</p>
    </blockquote>

    <p>
      When it's time, select a few and press <kbd class="kbd"><span aria-hidden="true">⇧⌘C</span><span class="sr-only">Shift Command C</span></kbd>. They copy as a numbered
      list for your chat and <span class="hl hl-green">get checked off</span>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Each list is a plain Markdown file in a folder you pick. Edit it anywhere, even while Crumbs runs.{" "}
      <span class="hl hl-amber">No account, no sync service, nothing leaves your Mac.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="sign">
      <p class="sign-hand"><span class="font-hand">Happy collecting,</span></p>
      <p class="sign-name">
        <Asterisk class="size-4 text-amber" />
        <span>the Crumbs folks</span>
      </p>
      <p class="reqs font-mono">
        <span>macOS 27+</span> · <span>Accessibility access</span> ·{" "}
        <span>capture key <span aria-hidden="true">⇧/⌘/⌥/⌃</span><span class="sr-only">Shift, Command, Option or Control</span></span> ·{" "}
        <span><span aria-hidden="true">⌃⌥C</span><span class="sr-only">Control Option C</span> toggles the panel</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    --rule: 26px;
    --fs: 16px;
    --col: 100%;
    --margin-x: 1.75rem;
    --gutter: 1rem;
    /* Puts the first rule a pixel under the body text baseline (Inter ascent 0.969, content 1.21em). */
    --shift: calc(var(--rule) * -0.5 + var(--fs) * 0.364 + 1px);
    font-size: var(--fs);
    line-height: var(--rule);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto {
      --rule: 30px;
      --fs: 17px;
      --col: 32.5rem;
      --margin-x: max(1.75rem, calc(50% - var(--col) / 2 - 5rem));
    }
  }

  .paper {
    --grid-x: calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter));
    --grid-y: var(--shift);
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000 calc(var(--rule) * 3), #000 calc(100% - var(--rule) * 6), transparent);
  }

  .sheet {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: calc(var(--rule) * 4) calc(var(--rule) * 5);
  }
  .sheet > :where(:not(.pull)) {
    margin-left: calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter));
    margin-right: 1.25rem;
    max-width: var(--col);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .sheet > :where(:not(.pull)) {
      margin-right: 0;
    }
  }
  .sheet > * + * {
    margin-top: var(--rule);
  }

  .title {
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: calc(var(--rule) * 2);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--rule);
    position: relative;
    top: 2px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .title {
      font-size: 52px;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      top: 4px;
    }
  }

  /* Inline pieces must stay inside the line box so every line keeps landing on a rule. */
  .hand {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 1.3em;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
    padding-inline: 0.04em;
  }
  .app {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 1.1em;
    height: 1.1em;
    margin-right: 0.2em;
    border-radius: 0.28em;
    color: #fff;
    vertical-align: -0.16em;
    line-height: 0;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06);
  }
  .chip :global(svg) {
    width: 0.78em;
    height: 0.78em;
  }
  .chip-web {
    background: oklch(0.62 0.15 245);
  }
  .chip-pdf {
    background: oklch(0.6 0.19 27);
  }
  .chip-term {
    background: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .chip-chat {
    background: oklch(0.68 0.15 150);
  }

  .wavy {
    text-decoration-line: underline;
    text-decoration-style: wavy;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-amber);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
    text-decoration-skip-ink: none;
  }
  .wavy-soft {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-amber-bright);
  }

  .manifesto :global(.kbd) {
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .pull {
    margin-block: calc(var(--rule) * 2);
    padding-left: calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter));
    padding-right: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: calc(var(--rule) * 2);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .pull p {
    position: relative;
    top: 3px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .pull {
      padding: 0;
      margin-left: max(1rem, calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter) - 5rem));
      width: calc(var(--col) + 10rem);
      max-width: calc(100% - 2rem);
      font-size: 34px;
    }
  }

  .sign {
    margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * 2);
  }
  /* Same trick as .hand: a zero line-height inline block shares the body baseline, so it sits on a grid line. */
  .sign-hand span {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.75em;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    transform-origin: left center;
  }
  .sign-name {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: var(--rule);
    height: var(--rule);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .reqs {
    margin-top: var(--rule);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: var(--rule);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    position: relative;
    top: -1px;
  }
  .reqs > span {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Small Crumbs UI cards stuck on the paper in the margins. */
  .floaters {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .floaters {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
    }
  }
  .float {
    --sticker-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgb(40 30 10 / 0.07),
      0 1px 2px rgb(40 30 10 / 0.06),
      0 1.2em 2.4em -1.1em rgb(70 45 10 / 0.32);
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--y);
    width: var(--w);
    transform: rotate(var(--r));
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Text', 'Inter Variable', Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(10.5px, 0.84vw, 12px);
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: -0.003em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    animation: drift var(--d) ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  /* Cards keep a fixed distance from the text column and never cross it, even at 1200px. */
  .at-left {
    left: max(1rem, calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter) - var(--gap) - var(--w)));
  }
  .at-right {
    left: calc(var(--margin-x) + var(--gutter) + var(--col) + var(--gap));
  }
  @keyframes drift {
    to {
      transform: translate(10px, -16px) rotate(calc(var(--r) + 1.2deg));
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .float {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .float b {
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .float code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .mini-panel {
    padding: 0.95em 0.8em 0.8em;
    border-radius: 1.7em;
    background: rgb(226 225 222);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55),
      var(--sticker-shadow);
  }
  .mp-wordmark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.12em;
    padding-left: 0.3em;
    font-family: var(--font-pixel);
    font-size: 1.45em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #2a2a2c;
  }
  .mp-wordmark :global(.mp-ast) {
    width: 0.42em;
    height: 0.42em;
    margin-top: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }
  .mp-searchrow {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5em;
    margin-top: 0.7em;
  }
  .mp-search {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45em;
    height: 2.3em;
    padding: 0 0.8em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
    color: #8a8a8f;
  }
  .mp-search-icon {
    width: 1em;
    height: 1em;
    color: #7c7c81;
  }
  .mp-more {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.3em;
    height: 2.3em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
  }
  .mp-more svg {
    width: 0.95em;
    fill: #3a3a3c;
  }
  .mp-sec {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55em;
    padding: 0.85em 0.45em 0.45em;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #828287;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .mp-sec-first {
    padding-top: 0.15em;
  }
  .mp-sec i {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  }
  .mp-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.7em;
    padding: 0.7em 0.85em;
    border-radius: 1.15em;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.95);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04);
  }
  .mp-row + .mp-row {
    margin-top: 0.5em;
  }
  .mp-check {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.15em;
    height: 1.15em;
    margin-top: 0.15em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 0.085em solid #8d8d92;
  }
  .mp-check svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: none;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .is-done {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-amber);
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }
  .is-done .mp-check {
    background: var(--color-amber);
    border-color: var(--color-amber);
  }
  .is-done p {
    color: #8a8a8f;
    text-decoration: line-through 1px #8a8a8f;
  }
  .mp-link {
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }
  .mp-toast {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45em;
    width: max-content;
    margin: 0.75em auto 0.1em;
    padding: 0.5em 1em 0.5em 0.8em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(250 250 250);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05),
      0 0.4em 1.1em rgb(0 0 0 / 0.14);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .mp-toast svg {
    width: 1.1em;
    height: 1.1em;
  }
  .mp-toast circle {
    fill: var(--color-amber);
  }
  .mp-toast path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  /* A lone note, as if peeled off the panel. */
  .mp-card .mp-row {
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: var(--sticker-shadow);
  }

  .hud {
    padding-top: 0.6em;
  }
  .hud-pointer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 0.95em;
    height: 1.45em;
    fill: #111;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 1.4;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25));
  }
  .hud-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    margin: 1.2em 0 0 0.9em;
    padding: 0.55em 1.05em 0.55em 0.85em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.86);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 0.6em 1.4em -0.4em rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4);
  }
  .hud-pill :global(.hud-ast) {
    width: 0.95em;
    height: 0.95em;
    color: var(--color-amber-bright);
  }

  .keys {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45em;
  }
  .keys span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.6em;
    height: 2.6em;
    border-radius: 0.55em;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgb(40 30 10 / 0.12),
      0 0.2em 0 rgb(40 30 10 / 0.14),
      0 0.8em 1.6em -0.6em rgb(70 45 10 / 0.35);
    font-size: 1.15em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #333;
  }
</style>
